===Etymology===
From {{der|en|xno|-}} {{m|fro|sacrestie}}, from {{der|en|ML.|-}} {{m|la|sacristia}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsækɹɪsti/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-sacristy.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[room]] in a [[church]] where sacred vessels, books, [[vestment]]s, etc. are kept. Sometimes also used by [[clergy]] to prepare for worship or for meetings.

